     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIf you wish to be considered for a free place to attend the introductory distance sampling workshop 07-18 October 2024, I hope you are working on your application materials.\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><b><i>Scholarship application deadline is Monday 22 July 2024.</i></b></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nEligibility, award criteria and application process are described at this link:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471804240000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2f413z-VBLNcuJUvCgrkxE\">https://workshops.distancesampling.org/widening-participation</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nYou are to send your CV, statement of interest and confirmation your internet resources are capable of video conferencing to me.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIf you have questions, please send questions to me, but hurry.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Eric Rexstad</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(12,100,192)\">Centre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">University of St Andrews</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Registered Charity in Scotland SC013532</span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
